      "reason": "Lean:149-150 uses '(Icc s (s+h)).indicator' of the complexified kernel; ledger:4616 and claims:7767 match. TeX:187-188 takes 'I=[t₀,t₀+h]⊂[0,T]' and TeX:391 uses '1_I K_ij'. Defining the function for unrestricted s,h is harmless."
