      "reason": "Lean:159 states '0 < Real.sqrt (bracket ‖ξ‖ * bracket ‖η‖)' for arbitrary ξ,η; ledger:4618 and claims:7781 agree. TeX:10-11 defines '⟨ξ⟩=√(1+|ξ|²)', making positivity implicit, not a labelled result."
