    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.WaveTwoVariances.isLocallyFinite_of_growth: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean:586-588 assumes '∀y r, 0<r → ν(ball y r)≤ofReal(C*r^α)' and concludes local finiteness; ledger:4643 and claims:7956 match. TeX:24 assumes ν Radon and TeX:25-28 gives growth; deriving local finiteness instead is accurately identified as a Lean-route auxiliary."
