    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.WaveTwoVariances.InputBound: E:wave-input-variance",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean:628-635 quantifies over every finite L²-orthonormal U and L² V, including spatial and weighted integrability and the spectral lower-integral bound; ledger:4646 and claims:7977 agree. TeX:374-376 bounds actual variances, using TeX:240-246 and 413-432. The ledger explicitly limits this definition to the spectral-side form, avoiding an identification with actual noise."
