    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.WaveTwoVariances.OutputBound: E:wave-output-variance",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Lean:641-648 fixes L² U and quantifies over finite L²-orthonormal V; ledger:4647 and claims:7984 match all three conjuncts. TeX:377-379 and 434-451 give this direction after the normalized-covariance inequality. The spectral-side qualification correctly distinguishes the definition from the stochastic conclusion."
