    {
      "claim": "LEDGER-INDEX",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "statement-ledger.md:387-394 lists all 50 target declarations exactly once, under the same labels as rows 4610-4659; the 24 no-direct-label declarations occupy the auxiliary row. Exact-label searches across the manuscript found every label cited by the reviewed section, with the relevant definitions and statements in integrated_wave_variance.tex, integrated_covariance_foundation.tex and H:homog in the main manuscript."
